# story/construction/ 是施工真源；.prewrite/ 与 .analysis/ 用于派生材料和待确认事项，默认不忽略。

# Agents
/.agents/
/.claude/
/.codex/
/.gemini/
/.grok/
/.qwen/
/.mcp.json
/opencode.json
/.codebuddy/
/.workbuddy-ai/
# Python local caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.uv-cache/

# Local metadata for analysis, export, and validation outputs
.analysis/*
!.analysis/README.md
!.analysis/blueprints/
!.analysis/blueprints/**
!.analysis/plotlines/
!.analysis/plotlines/**

# 原型检索的临时图片缓存；人工维护的 .prototypes/ Markdown 仍提交。
.prototypes/cache/

# Editor and temporary files
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Project-local story-writer state; generated and not committed.
/.sw/
tmp/
temp/

# Logs and other runtime files
/logs/

# 目录放行规则之后再次排除 macOS 元数据。
.DS_Store
